msgstr "IPv4 e IPv6"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "IPv4 only"
msgstr "IPv4 solament"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "IPv6 only"
msgstr "IPv6 solament"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Disable AAAA IPv6 DNS"
msgstr "Desactivar lo DNS AAAA IPv6"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Enable ndpi"
msgstr "Activar nDPI"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination domain names. Domain-based bypass "
"requires OpenMPTCProuter DNS to be used by clients."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de noms de domeni de destinacion. Lo "
"contorn per domeni exigís que los clients utilizen lo DNS d'OpenMPTCProuter."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Enable or disable this bypass rule without deleting it."
msgstr "Activar o desactivar aquesta règla de contorn sens la suprimir."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Enter a domain name to route through the selected interface or the server "
"VPN."
msgstr ""
"Picatz un nom de domeni d'encaminar per l'interfàcia seleccionada o lo VPN "
"del servidor."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Optional comment to help identify the purpose of this rule."
msgstr ""
"Comentari facultatiu per ajudar a identificar l'objectiu d'aquesta règla."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Limit the rule to IPv4 results, IPv6 results, or allow both."
msgstr ""
"Limitar la règla als resultats IPv4, als resultats IPv6, o permetre los dos."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Restrict the matched traffic to a specific transport protocol."
msgstr ""
"Restrénher lo trafic correspondent a un protocòl de transpòrt especific."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Ignore IPv6 AAAA DNS answers for this rule and only use IPv4 results."
msgstr ""
"Ignorar las responsas DNS AAAA IPv6 per aquesta règla e utilizar solament "
"los resultats IPv4."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Create rules that match destination IP addresses or networks directly."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon dirèctament a d'adreças IP o de rets de "
"destinacion."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Enter a destination IP address or network in CIDR notation."
msgstr "Picatz una adreça IP o una ret de destinacion en notacion CIDR."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination ports, for example to steer selected "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de pòrts de destinacion, per exemple per "
"dirigir de servicis causits."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Destination port number to match."
msgstr "Numèro de pòrt de destinacion de far correspondre."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Protocol to match for this destination port rule."
msgstr ""
"Protocòl de far correspondre per aquesta règla de pòrt de destinacion."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match source ports generated by local applications or "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de pòrts sorga generats per d'aplicacions"
" o de periferics locals."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Source port number to match."
msgstr "Numèro de pòrt sorga de far correspondre."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Protocol to match for this source port rule."
msgstr "Protocòl de far correspondre per aquesta règla de pòrt sorga."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from specific client devices by MAC address."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon al trafic de periferics client especifics "
"per adreça MAC."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Match traffic coming from this client MAC address."
msgstr "Far correspondre lo trafic que ven d'aquesta adreça MAC de client."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from a local source IP address or subnet."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon al trafic d'una adreça IP sorga locala o "
"d'un sosret."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Enter a source LAN IP address to match."
msgstr "Picatz una adreça IP LAN sorga de far correspondre."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destinations announced by a specific autonomous "
"system number."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de destinacions anonciadas per un numèro "
"de sistèma autonòm especific."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Enter the autonomous system number to match."
msgstr "Picatz lo numèro de sistèma autonòm de far correspondre."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match application protocols or services detected by nDPI."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de protocòls o de servicis d'aplicacion "
"detectats per nDPI."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Select the application protocol or service name to match."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionatz lo protocòl d'aplicacion o lo nom de servici de far "
"correspondre."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Enable deep packet inspection for this rule when nDPI support is available."
msgstr ""
"Activar l'inspeccion aprigondida dels paquets per aquesta règla quand lo "
"supòrt nDPI es disponible."
